# Large or generated trees. toolchain/ is the ARM compiler; qemu/ holds multi-GB
# disk images; film_eval/ is rendered evidence (regenerate with
# magiclantern/modules/film_sim/tools/gui_preview).
#
# magiclantern/ is NOT ignored: it used to be a second git repository of its
# own (MagicLatern-ML on GitHub), which meant the module and the thing that
# builds it lived in two histories and a release had to clone one from the
# other. It is tracked here now, one repo, and nested .gitignore files inside
# the tree still apply -- magiclantern/.gitignore covers ML's own *.bin/*.o,
# and modules/film_sim/.gitignore covers the host-test binaries.
# Anchored: an unanchored `tools/` also matches magiclantern/modules/film_sim/
# tools/, which is where the host harnesses, the ROM tool and the screen
# renderers live -- that mistake shipped a commit with no tools in it and CI
# failed on a missing preview.c.
/tools/
/toolchain/
/qemu/
/eos6d-v116-win/
/film_eval/

# Scratch
.DS_Store
*.swp
/tmp/

# Release artefacts (ci/release-build.sh writes these)
/dist/

# Third-party downloads kept locally for reference, not ours to redistribute:
# a commercial app installer and Fujifilm's own LUT package. They are on this
# disk, they are not part of the project.
DehancerDesktop_Installer*
gfx100II-*
gfx100ii_luts/
magiclantern/modules/film_sim/tools/calib/models/
